Protocol provenance note: the wired RGB framing and the logical key -> LED map
were reverse-engineered and hardware-validated by the `rk-m75` project
(https://github.com/Lightning-13/rk-m75, MIT) and by analysis of Royal Kludge's
own publicly distributed web driver. "Royal Kludge", "RK" and "M75" are
trademarks of their respective owners; this project is unaffiliated.
